---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Thank You | Little Eagle Football & Cheer"
  description="Thank you for registering with Somerset Little Eagle Football & Cheer. Here are the next steps: physicals, and how your coach will reach you."
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="main-content container">
    <section>
      <h1 class="as-h2">Thank You!</h1>
      <p>Now that you've signed up, here are some important things:</p>
      <br />
      <p>You will receive an email about your transaction.</p>
      <h3>Physicals</h3>
      <p>All football players will need the physical form completed by the first practice.</p>
      <br />
      <p>
        <a href={SITE.physicalFormPdf}>Click Here</a> for a physical form.
      </p>
      <h3>Contact and Communications</h3>
      <p>Your coach will reach out to you prior to the season.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
